At twelve o'clock, I go to the canteen with my colleague Peter.
In the canteen, we take plates with warm food.
We sit down at a table by the window.
We eat the good food and talk together.
Peter looks out the window.
"It is very grey today," he says.
I smile and nod.
"Yes, the Danish winter weather is cold!" I reply.
We laugh.
Luckily, it is warm and cozy inside here.
